Answer: The object can be created and its methods can be called as follows:

```java
CargoPlane cp = new CargoPlane();
cp.fly();
cp.carryCargo();
cp.land();
```

Here: cp.fly() calls the inherited method. cp.carryCargo() calls the specialized method. cp.land() calls the overridden method.

